  "title": "RTPS: fix off-by-one in NACK_FRAG bitmap display",
  "description": "rtps_util_add_fragment_number_set truncated the bitmap string at the\nposition of the last '1' rather than after it, dropping that bit from\nthe display. The fix adds + 1 to the truncation length.\n\nThe identical trimming logic in rtps_util_add_bitmap (used for\nSequenceNumberSet in ACKNACK) already had the correct + 1.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
